    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHooke & MacDonald are delighted to present this two-bedroom, two-bathroom, fourth floor apartment, including a designated car parking space in the basement, to the market. This bright and spacious apartment is ideally located in the heart of the city centre, within the Cosgrave-built development Ivy Exchange.\n\nNo. 207 extends to 72 sq.m / 775 sq.ft offers well portioned accommodation throughout and comprises, entrance hallway, large open plan living/ dining area and fully equipped kitchen, featuring floor to ceiling windows, allowing natural light to flood the room. There are two large double bedrooms, one with ensuite and a main bathroom. There is also a laundry room, which is located just off the hallway. \n\nIvy Exchange offers an exceptional central location on Parnell Street, directly opposite the Ilac Centre and within easy walking distance of Dublin city centre. No. 207 is situated in the block accessed from Granby Place off Parnell Square West, offering a slightly quieter aspect while retaining immediate access to the city's amenities. The property is convenient to Tesco, Cineworld, Jervis Shopping Centre, Arnotts and everything the city has to offer, with a wide choice of bars, cafes, and restaurants close by. Excellent public transport links are available, including the LUAS and numerous bus routes available in the immediate vicinity."
      },
